OL,3,GNEWSAChristmas takes over village again
OL,4,Afor 49th show
OL,5,
OL,6,FTens of thousands of people from across
OL,7,Fthe UK are about to descend on a rural
OL,8,Fvillage for a Christmas event now in
OL,9,Fits 49th year.
OL,11,FThe Thursford Christmas Spectacular was
OL,12,Ffirst held in 1977 and it has grown
OL,13,Finto a show seen by an estimated six
OL,14,Fmillion people since it began.
OL,16,FThe variety show, which features
OL,17,Fsinging, dancing, music and comedy, has
OL,18,Fa cast of about 140 and employs
OL,19,Fhundreds of others behind the scenes.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
